    <title>Pabst Blue Ribbon Offers $20K Reward for Missing Beer From Truck Heist</title>
    <link>https://www.claimsjournal.com/news/national/2026/09/04/339970.htm</link>
    <description>Pabst Blue Ribbon wants its beer back, and it’s offering a reward to help that happen. Greig DeBow, the CEO of Pabst Brewing Co., said Wednesday that the company will pay up to $20,000 to anyone who provides new information that leads to the recovery of 1,602 cases of Pabst Blue Ribbon and non-alcoholic Old Milwaukee beer. In the first heist, about $45,000 worth of beer headed to Tucson, Arizona, was picked up but never delivered, according to police.</description>
